  "title": "US District Judge Loretta Preska rules in favor of the turnover of Argentina's interest in YPF, Bloomberg reports",
  "summary": "US District Judge Loretta Preska has ruled in favor of the turnover of Argentina's interest in YPF to the Petersen and Eton Park plaintiffs. Bloomberg reports on this news, stating: \"Now, it’s becoming increasingly difficult for [President Milei] to avoid the elephant in the room: a $16 billion court judgment against Argentina that his government can neither afford to settle nor duck for much longer.\" Learn more.",
